-- ownership: a list literal of 100 list parameters (issue #293). Each item
-- of a stored list must share no list with the others (§18.2's table), so
-- the literal's condition has an atom per item and per pair: 5 050. It was
-- built by `condAnd`, one conjunction at a time, each re-sorting every atom
-- gathered so far, which made the walk O(n⁴) in time and memory: 12.6
-- billion instructions here, three times the budget. The atoms are now
-- gathered and sorted once, and the report is the same.
